Von's model uses the ModernBERT encoder:
  ModernBERT, Answer.AI and LightOn (https://github.com/AnswerDotAI/ModernBERT)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Tars reuses Von's model class (von.models.option_marker), its training
collator and loss (training/train_option_marker.py) and its synthetic
general-reasoning generator (training/generate_synthetic_decisions.py),
imported from a Von checkout rather than copied.

Training phrasings for the example catalog were written by Anthropic's
Claude (via the Claude Code CLI). Check Anthropic's terms before
redistributing generated datasets.
